          "kind": "beat",
          "id": "party-straw",
          "layout": "beat intv-beat",
          "heading": "PARTY",
          "heading_tag": "h3",
          "heading_class": "ser r",
          "role": "",
          "fact": "An oversized dollar bill and cocaine staged on the street. Money as appetite, status and the performance of excess.",
