          "ABOUT",
          "概要"
        ]
      },
      "lede": "<b>Matt Adam</b> is a visual architect based in Los Angeles, from Toronto, working across photography, art, creative direction, objects, and public interventions. His work is built around control: appetite, status, self-optimization, and the systems shaping what people want. He built visual worlds for Future and Metro Boomin, Juice WRLD, The Weeknd, and Benny Blanco; created <b>Unwrap &amp; Steal</b>; and has work featured by <b>NBC News</b>, <b>Taschen</b>, and <b>Beyond the Streets</b>."
    },
