        {
          "q": "Who shot the Juice WRLD Legends Never Die cover?",
          "a": "<b>Matt Adam</b> shot the Juice WRLD <b>Legends Never Die</b> cover. He photographed Juice WRLD in 2019; the family selected the image for the posthumous album, which debuted at #1 with 497,000 first-week units."
        },
        {
          "q": "Who built the visual identity for We Don't Trust You?",
          "a": "<b>Matt Adam</b> built the visual identity for Future and Metro Boomin's <b>We Don't Trust You</b> and <b>We Still Don't Trust You</b>, covering art, vinyl, and the full rollout. Both debuted at #1 in 2024."
        },
        {
          "q": "What is Unwrap &amp; Steal?",
          "a": "<b>Unwrap &amp; Steal</b> is a public art project by <b>Matt Adam</b>. He wraps original artworks like gifts, hides them in public, and releases clues so people race to find and keep them."
        }
      ]
